<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Use it to find somebody to play with, in the place where the players are. Run it in a game's channel. A card with one open seat appears there, and whoever presses Join first plays you."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Syntax")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/lfg [mode]")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tag}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Parameters")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <code>mode</code>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "— A mode of the channel's game. Without one, you play the standard game."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Rules & Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "Only in a game's own channel")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "The first player who presses Join plays you")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "Needs a registered nickname you have identified")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "One open seat per game and channel. Asking again points at the same card."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "A seat nobody takes expires after about fifteen minutes")}</li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Examples")}</.help_h4>
<pre>/lfg
/lfg blitz</pre>
